          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 127579,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita tahu cara mengulangi kode menggunakan loop <code>while</code>. Seperti program ini yang mengulangi pernyataan untuk menampilkan Bendera Amerika.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" firstCounter = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" firstCounter &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" { \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;**********---------&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  firstCounter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" secondCounter = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" secondCounter &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;-------------------&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  secondCounter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /></content></output></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 127580,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dengan menggunakan <strong>for loops</strong>, kita bisa menulis program dengan kode yang jauh lebih sedikit dan membuatnya lebih mudah dipahami oleh programmer lain.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"_\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;**********---------&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"_\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;-------------------&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /></content></output></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 127581,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk membuat loop <code>for</code> seperti ini, tambahkan keyword <code>for</code>, variabel seperti <code>i</code>, kata <code>in</code>, dan terakhir range <code>1...5</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"14\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>for</code>, diikuti oleh <code>i</code>, lalu <code>in</code>, <code>1...5</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 127583,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Menambah rentang di dalam <code>0...5</code> berarti blok kode tersebut akan diulang 6 kali, dari <code>0</code> hingga <code>5</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"14\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>0...5</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 127584,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variabel sebelum <code>in</code>, dalam hal ini, <code>i</code>, adalah variabel penghitung. Variabel ini menghitung pengulangan ke berapa dari loop yang sedang kita jalankan.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;For loops are great!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"For loops are great!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"For loops are great!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"For loops are great!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>i</code>, diikuti oleh <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
