            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Di dalam loop <code>for</code>, tampilkan nilai variabel penghitung.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" x \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Round:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(x)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"i\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Round:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Round:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Round:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Round:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Round:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>print</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>x</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
